A future release will check a license before the press starts. The seam for
that check is `src/license/check.ts` (`uncheckedLicense` / `licenseBlocks`)
and the Tauri command `license_check`. This edition always reports
`unchecked` and does not block.

opencode, which Folio runs as a sidecar, is MIT licensed. Its notice is in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and must stay with any copy of that program.
